WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:02:46.213 --> 00:02:48.738
I win.

00:03:32.659 --> 00:03:38.064
What a delightful spring morning!
It cleanses both body and soul.

00:03:38.064 --> 00:03:39.266
- Aye.
- Aye.

00:03:39.266 --> 00:03:43.635
My song to my beloved is finished.

00:03:45.605 --> 00:03:47.274
Lord Tenchi!

00:03:47.274 --> 00:03:49.676
Oh, Lord Tenchi! Lord Tenchi!

00:03:49.676 --> 00:03:52.543
I need nothing but Lord Tenchi!

00:03:54.214 --> 00:03:56.082
Magnificent!

00:03:56.082 --> 00:03:58.744
Just as one would expect from
the First Princess of Planet Jurai!

00:04:06.993 --> 00:04:09.062
Oh, so this is where it comes out.

00:04:09.062 --> 00:04:12.899
Washu?! Isn't it a little
early for this sort of thing?

00:04:12.899 --> 00:04:14.467
Oh. Good morning, Ayeka.

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:17.437
My all-nighter experiment
was a resounding success!

00:04:17.437 --> 00:04:19.372
I made this Dimension Tunnel!

00:04:19.372 --> 00:04:22.569
Am I a genius, or what?

00:04:24.678 --> 00:04:27.213
It's morning! It's morning, everybody!

00:04:27.213 --> 00:04:28.748
Get up, everybody!

00:04:28.748 --> 00:04:31.451
The weather's fine! It's another
beautiful morning in Japan!

00:04:31.451 --> 00:04:33.887
- Good morning, Sasami.
- 'Morning.

00:04:33.887 --> 00:04:36.990
Ayeka! Washu! Good morning!

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.151
C'mere, Ryo-Ohki!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.194
And, as always, the last ones up...

00:04:41.194 --> 00:04:44.230
...are <i>Tenchi!</i> And <i>Ryoko!</i> And <i>Mr. Masaki!</i>

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.498
Wake up!

00:04:45.498 --> 00:04:50.170
Um, Sasami? I've been
right here the whole time.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:53.473
I guess I just don't stand out,
not with all the people here.

00:04:53.473 --> 00:04:55.075
Now, now...

00:04:55.075 --> 00:04:57.310
Tenchi! Ryoko!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.981
S-Stop that!

00:05:00.981 --> 00:05:04.985
P-Please, stop that... Somebody help me!

00:05:04.985 --> 00:05:06.686
What's wrong, Ryoko?

00:05:06.686 --> 00:05:09.086
Uh, Sasami?

00:05:10.657 --> 00:05:12.626
I feel horrible...

00:05:12.626 --> 00:05:14.527
Sasami, get me some water...

00:05:14.527 --> 00:05:17.397
I had Ryoko try some liquor that I made.

00:05:17.397 --> 00:05:19.499
I passed out after one swig.

00:05:19.499 --> 00:05:21.501
It's the strongest stuff in the universe!

00:05:21.501 --> 00:05:22.991
What?!

00:05:24.437 --> 00:05:26.439
What a stench!

00:05:26.439 --> 00:05:29.237
- What's that smell?!
- Sasami, I need water!

00:05:29.609 --> 00:05:32.646
Tenchi! How long are
you gonna stay in bed?!

00:05:32.646 --> 00:05:35.315
Good morning, Tenchi! Huh?

00:05:35.315 --> 00:05:38.341
Where'd he go?

00:06:00.006 --> 00:06:02.809
Breakfast! Breakfast!

00:06:02.809 --> 00:06:05.642
Watch... this!

00:06:08.248 --> 00:06:10.984
You're hard at work down
here all by yourself every morning.

00:06:10.984 --> 00:06:12.385
Grandpa Masaki!

00:06:12.385 --> 00:06:15.689
You cook meals for nine people...

00:06:15.689 --> 00:06:18.625
Three of us men, and six of
you ladies from outer space.

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:22.328
It's okay, we're freeloaders here!
This is the least we can do!

00:06:22.328 --> 00:06:26.866
And... this is the only way I can repay you.

00:06:26.866 --> 00:06:29.803
Sasami, you're such a fine girl.

00:06:29.803 --> 00:06:33.606
Very well, I've decided! You're the
one who's going to marry Tenchi!

00:06:33.606 --> 00:06:38.078
Sister! I'm gonna be Tenchi's bride!

00:06:38.078 --> 00:06:44.417
Grandfather Masaki!
Tenchi is bound to me by fate!

00:06:44.417 --> 00:06:47.654
Oh, dear. I... That just slipped out.

00:06:47.654 --> 00:06:54.427
But I sense a deep bond between
Tenchi and those of us from Jurai,

00:06:54.427 --> 00:06:57.664
something that goes far beyond fate!

00:06:57.664 --> 00:07:00.533
Especially between Tenchi and me.

00:07:00.533 --> 00:07:03.525
Yes... Ever since that day, I...

00:07:05.305 --> 00:07:09.109
You are such a good cook, Sasami!

00:07:09.109 --> 00:07:12.245
- Thank you!
- Hey!

00:07:12.245 --> 00:07:14.047
Ayeka? Tea, please.

00:07:14.047 --> 00:07:15.708
Yes, Sir.

00:07:21.521 --> 00:07:24.591
Pull over! This is dangerous!

00:07:24.591 --> 00:07:26.960
Kiyone is really mad!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.394
Mihoshi! That does it!

00:07:28.394 --> 00:07:32.932
I'm taking this guy down for speed
violations and obstruction of justice!

00:07:32.932 --> 00:07:37.926
Don't mess with cops from the
Earth substation of the Galaxy Police!

00:07:39.739 --> 00:07:41.841
Mihoshi! Transport him to HQ!

00:07:41.841 --> 00:07:45.345
Now transporting!

00:07:45.345 --> 00:07:47.447
Now, let's head back to the
barn and grab some breakfast!

00:07:47.447 --> 00:07:48.481
We can't!

00:07:48.481 --> 00:07:49.149
Why not?

00:07:49.149 --> 00:07:51.584
We're out of fuel!

00:07:51.584 --> 00:07:54.087
What?!

00:07:54.087 --> 00:07:55.388
What's going on?

00:07:55.388 --> 00:07:57.991
Mihoshi and Kiyone are back.

00:07:57.991 --> 00:07:59.959
Why can't they come pay
a visit like normal people?

00:07:59.959 --> 00:08:03.997
Last night, sightings of
glowing objects were reported

00:08:03.997 --> 00:08:06.166
in several locations throughout the city.

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.735
These sightings centered
around shrines and historic sites.

00:08:08.735 --> 00:08:12.728
- The police are currently investigating.
- Pretty strange, huh?

00:08:13.907 --> 00:08:16.576
Something is happening.

00:08:16.576 --> 00:08:18.478
Tenchi.

00:08:18.478 --> 00:08:22.849
I won't force the issue. If you
don't want to do it, just say so.

00:08:22.849 --> 00:08:25.752
It's okay. I've already made up my mind.

00:08:25.752 --> 00:08:28.188
I see. In that case, I'll tell everyone.

00:08:28.188 --> 00:08:30.256
No, I'll tell them.

00:08:30.256 --> 00:08:32.258
Over here, everybody!

00:08:32.258 --> 00:08:36.162
Ta-dah! This is the Washu Hologram Camera!

00:08:36.162 --> 00:08:39.299
I don't get it! Why are we
taking a picture all of a sudden?

00:08:39.299 --> 00:08:41.301
I like pictures!

00:08:41.301 --> 00:08:43.803
Sorry, everybody. I asked her to do it.

00:08:43.803 --> 00:08:45.171
You asked her, Tenchi?

00:08:45.171 --> 00:08:46.706
Right. Huh? Where's Ryoko?

00:08:46.706 --> 00:08:48.274
Sleeping off a hangover.

00:08:48.274 --> 00:08:50.376
She said she probably wouldn't
be able to get out of bed for a while.

00:08:50.376 --> 00:08:53.379
Um, Washu? Is that really a camera?

00:08:53.379 --> 00:08:57.150
It's a hologram camera
that uses a high-output laser!

00:08:57.150 --> 00:09:00.085
Say I wanted to take a picture
of that mountain, for instance...

00:09:02.021 --> 00:09:04.888
Okay, everybody! Ready!

00:09:12.532 --> 00:09:14.567
Thanks, everybody.

00:09:14.567 --> 00:09:17.704
But why did you want to
take a picture now, Lord Tenchi?

00:09:17.704 --> 00:09:20.907
Today isn't anybody's birthday, is it?

00:09:20.907 --> 00:09:23.876
There's something I need to tell you.

00:09:26.946 --> 00:09:28.414
You're transferring to...

00:09:28.414 --> 00:09:29.716
...a high school in Tokyo?!

00:09:29.716 --> 00:09:31.618
I'm leaving home tomorrow.

00:09:31.618 --> 00:09:33.119
This is a little sudden, isn't it?

00:09:33.119 --> 00:09:36.322
I didn't hear anything about this!
I'm your father! Your father!

00:09:36.322 --> 00:09:39.092
Sorry. Grandpa and I have
been talking it over for a while.

00:09:39.092 --> 00:09:41.861
How long will you be in that far-off place,

00:09:41.861 --> 00:09:43.496
leaving me behind?

00:09:43.496 --> 00:09:45.598
I probably won't be back for two years.

00:09:45.598 --> 00:09:46.766
Two years?

00:09:46.766 --> 00:09:50.136
Tenchi! You don't hate me, do you?!

00:09:50.136 --> 00:09:51.571
No, that's not it at all.

00:09:51.571 --> 00:09:53.640
I think you guys are the greatest.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.675
Why, then? Why are you leaving?

00:09:55.675 --> 00:09:57.477
I'll explain.

00:09:57.477 --> 00:10:00.947
While in Tokyo on business a few days ago,

00:10:00.947 --> 00:10:04.651
I met the great priest Dokuzen Tsuchida.

00:10:04.651 --> 00:10:09.622
He said that he would make Tenchi
into a fine heir for the Masaki Shrine,

00:10:09.622 --> 00:10:12.692
so he asked me to send
Tenchi to him for training.

00:10:12.692 --> 00:10:14.160
Couldn't you have turned him down?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.128
Right!

00:10:15.128 --> 00:10:18.298
Tsuchida's ancestors
did me a great service,

00:10:18.298 --> 00:10:21.534
building the Masaki Shrine.

00:10:21.534 --> 00:10:23.870
I couldn't look him in
the eye and turn him down.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:28.474
See? This is what I always
hated about this business!

00:10:28.474 --> 00:10:30.443
It won't be the same
around here without Tenchi.

00:10:30.443 --> 00:10:33.379
Right! It's because of
Tenchi that the Galaxy Police...

00:10:33.379 --> 00:10:36.516
...were able to set up an Earth station!

00:10:36.516 --> 00:10:38.284
If he's not here, we can't...

00:10:38.284 --> 00:10:40.753
You go, Mr. Masaki!

00:10:40.753 --> 00:10:41.654
Huh? Me?

00:10:41.654 --> 00:10:44.357
You're the heir to the
Masaki Shrine, aren't you?!

00:10:44.357 --> 00:10:46.621
Ryo-Ohki! Take care of it!

00:10:52.665 --> 00:10:55.034
Buh-bye!

00:10:55.034 --> 00:10:56.569
Cut it out!

00:10:56.569 --> 00:10:57.136
"Eh?!"
Cut it out!

00:10:58.571 --> 00:11:01.140
I've made up my mind. I'm going to Tokyo.

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:04.277
Tenchi! No! I don't...

00:11:04.277 --> 00:11:05.678
Very well.

00:11:05.678 --> 00:11:09.215
If this is Tenchi's decision,
we have to accept it.

00:11:09.215 --> 00:11:11.417
Ayeka... Are you sure?

00:11:11.417 --> 00:11:15.722
We've been nothing but a burden to him.

00:11:15.722 --> 00:11:18.623
This is how we can repay him.

00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:20.793
I'm sorry this is so sudden.

00:11:20.793 --> 00:11:23.956
Train hard and then
come back to us, all right?

00:11:27.467 --> 00:11:30.903
Tenchi... I love you...

00:12:02.468 --> 00:12:03.336
"Tenmangu High School"

00:12:03.336 --> 00:12:04.437
"Tenmangu High School"
Wait up!

00:12:04.437 --> 00:12:04.835
Wait up!

00:12:24.157 --> 00:12:25.818
Bye!

00:12:28.361 --> 00:12:31.631
Tsuchida found a fine room for you.

00:12:31.631 --> 00:12:32.632
He sure did.

00:12:32.632 --> 00:12:34.934
Let's get going, Grandpa.

00:12:34.934 --> 00:12:38.028
We should go introduce ourselves.

00:12:52.852 --> 00:12:54.342
"Tsuchida Shrine"

00:12:55.988 --> 00:12:57.890
I'll take good care of him.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:02.762
Just leave everything to Dokuzen.
I'll make a fine priest out of him.

00:13:02.762 --> 00:13:04.363
Thank you.

00:13:04.363 --> 00:13:06.957
I'm sorry to trouble you like this.

00:13:07.834 --> 00:13:10.770
Actually, maybe you could
do a favor for me in return.

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:14.373
Do you think you could do a
site purification for me tomorrow?

00:13:14.373 --> 00:13:15.041
Hm?

00:13:15.041 --> 00:13:16.642
A purification ceremony!

00:13:16.642 --> 00:13:20.847
Something came up, and
I can't make it. Could you handle it?

00:13:20.847 --> 00:13:22.415
It's the least I can do.

00:13:22.415 --> 00:13:26.052
I shall do this for you before I return.

00:13:26.052 --> 00:13:29.222
Thanks, I appreciate it!
I'll leave it to you, then.

00:13:29.222 --> 00:13:30.957
Tenchi, you'll help me, won't you?

00:13:30.957 --> 00:13:32.447
Yes, Sir.

00:13:33.226 --> 00:13:36.262
Sasami, what's for dinner?

00:13:36.262 --> 00:13:37.096
What's wrong?

00:13:37.096 --> 00:13:40.800
She says that Tenchi left so suddenly,
she doesn't feel like doing anything.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.235
What about dinner, then?

00:13:42.235 --> 00:13:44.137
Isn't any.

00:13:44.137 --> 00:13:46.706
Is there any of that instant ramen left?

00:13:46.706 --> 00:13:48.908
Yep! And we'll cut you a deal, Mr. Masaki!

00:13:48.908 --> 00:13:51.310
It's now at the low, low price of 500 yen!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.312
F-Five hundred yen?!

00:13:53.312 --> 00:13:54.647
Nobody's putting a gun to your head.

00:13:54.647 --> 00:13:56.549
- I'll take one!
- Nice doing business with you!

00:13:56.549 --> 00:13:58.449
Hey, you're good at this!

00:14:00.253 --> 00:14:01.254
I guess I've got no choice.

00:14:01.254 --> 00:14:03.022
I'll take one!

00:14:03.022 --> 00:14:04.957
Been a pleasure!

00:14:04.957 --> 00:14:07.693
- I'll take one!
- Sorry, we're sold out!

00:14:07.693 --> 00:14:09.962
You must be joking!

00:14:09.962 --> 00:14:13.363
Looks like you'd better give
up on dinner today, Nobuyuki.

00:14:17.837 --> 00:14:20.039
We've got an early day tomorrow, Tenchi.

00:14:20.039 --> 00:14:21.529
Right.

00:14:37.823 --> 00:14:40.519
Tenchi Masaki...

00:14:51.137 --> 00:14:53.806
I exorcise thee, I appease thee...

00:14:53.806 --> 00:14:56.876
They say this land's been
left undeveloped for 50 years.

00:14:56.876 --> 00:15:00.112
I didn't know there were
still places like that around here.

00:15:00.112 --> 00:15:04.412
I redeem thee, I ward thee away...

00:15:09.188 --> 00:15:10.883
What the...

00:15:16.395 --> 00:15:21.389
Suppose ye that such power
will exorcise me? Exorcise me?

00:15:22.702 --> 00:15:25.204
Nobody's gonna exorcise me!

00:15:25.204 --> 00:15:26.606
Grandpa, what is that?

00:15:26.606 --> 00:15:28.307
A spirit that protects this place.

00:15:28.307 --> 00:15:30.610
That's right!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.613
Leave this place!

00:15:33.613 --> 00:15:38.676
This land is ours!

00:15:40.653 --> 00:15:43.155
It seems that this place's
various guardian sprits...

00:15:43.155 --> 00:15:45.124
...from throughout the
ages have been awakened.

00:15:45.124 --> 00:15:47.217
You can't be serious!

00:15:48.828 --> 00:15:50.296
Stand back, Tenchi.

00:15:50.296 --> 00:15:53.032
Watch my divine power
drive these spirits away!

00:15:53.032 --> 00:15:56.002
Ye wandering spirits,
by the power of Kamunagara...

00:15:56.002 --> 00:15:59.199
...I exorcise and appease thee!

00:16:09.081 --> 00:16:10.316
Well, Tenchi?

00:16:10.316 --> 00:16:12.885
Such is the power which is
passed down in the Masaki Shrine.

00:16:12.885 --> 00:16:16.555
You, too, must learn this.

00:16:16.555 --> 00:16:18.324
Uh, Grandpa? Grandpa?

00:16:18.324 --> 00:16:19.814
What?

00:16:22.795 --> 00:16:25.564
What weaklings these mortals be!

00:16:25.564 --> 00:16:27.433
Now you die!

00:16:27.433 --> 00:16:29.302
What do we do now, Grandpa?

00:16:29.302 --> 00:16:31.270
We run, Tenchi!

00:16:38.678 --> 00:16:40.543
Stop!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.516
Do something, Grandpa!

00:16:43.516 --> 00:16:48.254
Damn! I wish we had at
least brought Ayeka along!

00:16:48.254 --> 00:16:49.915
Say what?!

00:16:52.258 --> 00:16:57.059
What's the big idea, packing
up and moving while I'm asleep?!

00:16:58.497 --> 00:17:01.567
And how come his
dad didn't know about it?!

00:17:01.567 --> 00:17:04.303
It was as much a shock
to me as everybody else!

00:17:04.303 --> 00:17:08.140
Ayeka! You didn't tell me on purpose!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:12.144
It's your own fault for
being in bed with a hangover!

00:17:12.144 --> 00:17:15.514
But that was... It was Washu's...

00:17:15.514 --> 00:17:18.050
Washu!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.253
It's your fault for making me
drink that weird brew of yours!

00:17:21.253 --> 00:17:26.158
All right, all right. I'll let you use my
Dimension Tunnel to go see Tenchi.

00:17:26.158 --> 00:17:28.285
I'm coming, too!

00:17:28.527 --> 00:17:30.463
Me, too!

00:17:30.463 --> 00:17:31.697
Count me in, then.

00:17:31.697 --> 00:17:34.495
Then we'll all go see Tenchi together.

00:17:38.204 --> 00:17:41.332
Now you die!

00:17:45.211 --> 00:17:47.179
Tenchi!

00:17:47.179 --> 00:17:48.347
Ryoko?

00:17:48.347 --> 00:17:51.450
Tenchi! I missed you!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:52.651
Guys?

00:17:52.651 --> 00:17:54.820
Tenchi!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:57.056
They all said they wanted to go see you.

00:17:57.056 --> 00:17:58.557
Are you okay?

00:17:58.557 --> 00:17:59.925
How you doing?

00:17:59.925 --> 00:18:04.397
Forgive us, Lord Tenchi.
We don't mean to impose.

00:18:04.397 --> 00:18:08.167
That's okay. Actually, we
were sorta wishing you were here.

00:18:08.167 --> 00:18:09.769
Right, Grandpa?

00:18:09.769 --> 00:18:11.771
Right. To tell you the truth,

00:18:11.771 --> 00:18:17.243
you see those weak-looking
monsters over there?

00:18:17.243 --> 00:18:20.346
They said they're going to kill Tenchi and me.

00:18:20.346 --> 00:18:21.280
What?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.348
Kill...

00:18:22.348 --> 00:18:24.373
...Tenchi?

00:18:24.817 --> 00:18:28.446
That's right! We're going to kill them!

00:18:32.558 --> 00:18:36.061
Well, well. You actually
frightened me for a moment.

00:18:36.061 --> 00:18:37.551
But...

00:18:42.902 --> 00:18:44.836
You people...

00:18:45.304 --> 00:18:49.138
...are way outta your league!

00:18:56.749 --> 00:19:00.186
You won't lay a finger on Lord Tenchi!

00:19:00.186 --> 00:19:02.416
Let's do it, Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:06.725 --> 00:19:09.285
Let's take him down!

00:19:18.571 --> 00:19:19.538
Yeah!

00:19:19.538 --> 00:19:23.235
And for the <i>coup de grâce,</i>
Washu's special Drink of the Gods!

00:19:23.776 --> 00:19:26.545
I'll shoot it!

00:19:26.545 --> 00:19:28.080
I can't hit it!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.682
Move it!

00:19:29.682 --> 00:19:32.150
Mihoshi! Target is about to explode!

00:19:42.061 --> 00:19:43.362
What are these?

00:19:43.362 --> 00:19:49.267
Oh, I see now! They were money
spirits that had possessed this money.

00:19:53.372 --> 00:19:54.807
Take care, Tenchi.

00:19:54.807 --> 00:19:57.376
Remember, eat three square meals a day!

00:19:57.376 --> 00:19:58.744
Sure.

00:19:58.744 --> 00:20:01.680
Living away from you will be lonely,

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:06.385
but with Washu's Dimension Tunnel,
we can see each other anytime.

00:20:06.385 --> 00:20:09.388
I can't say I like this.

00:20:09.388 --> 00:20:11.290
But there's somethin' kinda dirty
about being a long-distance wife,

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.690
so I ain't complaining!

00:20:15.427 --> 00:20:18.197
Who's a long-distance wife, Ryoko?

00:20:18.197 --> 00:20:22.234
Tenchi! I know you'll be lonely
without me, but try to put up with it!

00:20:22.234 --> 00:20:26.500
I'm the only one who really loves you.

00:20:28.707 --> 00:20:30.709
Bye-bye, Tenchi!

00:20:30.709 --> 00:20:32.745
'Bye.

00:20:32.745 --> 00:20:34.213
Oh, man...

00:20:34.213 --> 00:20:38.673
I've got a new life
starting tomorrow in Tokyo.

00:20:39.585 --> 00:20:42.388
I'm Tenchi Masaki. Pleased to meet you.

00:20:42.388 --> 00:20:44.657
Let's hear it, everybody!

00:20:44.657 --> 00:20:47.593
Just pick any open seat you want.

00:20:47.593 --> 00:20:49.962
Around here, students just
pick a seat as they come in.

00:20:49.962 --> 00:20:51.597
Right.

00:20:51.597 --> 00:20:53.465
Okay, that's all for homeroom today.

00:20:53.465 --> 00:20:54.667
Um...

00:20:54.667 --> 00:20:56.101
Hi.

00:20:56.101 --> 00:20:59.405
I'm Sakuya Kumashiro.

00:20:59.405 --> 00:21:01.965
I think I'm in love.

00:21:36.375 --> 00:21:39.979
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.979 --> 00:21:43.882
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.882 --> 00:21:47.486
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.486 --> 00:21:51.423
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.423 --> 00:21:54.927
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.927 --> 00:21:58.897
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.897 --> 00:22:02.234
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.234 --> 00:22:06.238
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.238 --> 00:22:08.374
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.374 --> 00:22:10.309
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.309 --> 00:22:11.810
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:17.650
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:21.754
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.754 --> 00:22:25.024
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:25.024 --> 00:22:28.560
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:33.259
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:45.411 --> 00:22:47.713
Hey. I'm Ryoko.

00:22:47.713 --> 00:22:50.549
Hey, who's the girl, Tenchi?

00:22:50.549 --> 00:22:55.354
I came all this way to see you,
and I find you foolin' around!

00:22:55.354 --> 00:22:57.790
And on top of that, you've got guts,

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:00.926
taking the goddess of
marriage with you on a date!

00:23:00.926 --> 00:23:03.962
You ready to pay the piper?

00:23:03.962 --> 00:23:08.867
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Four's a Crowd."

00:23:08.867 --> 00:23:11.233
You won't get away with this, Tenchi!
